    <Element type="timing" name="LYRICS_MrGrinch_Thurl">
      <EffectLayer>
        <Effect label="your a mean one, Mister Grinch You really are a heel  your as cuddly as a cactus your as charming as an eel, Mister Grr Inch your a bad banana With a greasy black peel  your a monster, Mister Grinch Your hearts an empty hole  Your brain is full of spiders You&amp;apos;ve got garlic in your soul, Mister Grr Inch I wouldn&amp;apos;t touch you With a thirty nine and a half foot pole  your a tile one, Mister Grinch You have termites in your smile  You have all the tender sweetness Of a sea sick crocodile, Mister Grr Inch Given the choice between the two of you I&amp;apos;d take the sea sick crocodile  your a foul one, Mister Grinch your a nasty, wasty skunk  Your heart is full of unwashed socks Your soul is full of runt, Mister Grr inch The three words that best describe you Are as follows, and I quote: Stink. Stank. Stunk.  your a rotter, Mister Grinch your the king of sin full tots  Your hearts a dead tomato splotched With moldy purple spots, Mister Grr inch Your soul is an appalling dump heap Over flowing with the most dis graceful assortment Of deplorable rubbish imaginable Mangled up in tangled up knots  You nauseate me, Mister Grinch With a nauseous super toss your a crooked, jerky jockey And you drive a crooked hoss, Grr inch your a three decker sour trout and toad stool sandwich With are sin tick sauce" startTime="4575" endTime="170000" />
      </EffectLayer>
